{
  "name": "ShowMetricsMetaInfo",
  "summary": "查询对应namespace下的指标",
  "tags": "租户保障",
  "productshort": "ManageOneOCHCS",
  "region_id": "cn-north-4",
  "paths": {
    "/V1.0/{project_id}/metrics-console": {
      "get": {
        "summary": "查询对应namespace下的指标",
        "description": "查询对应namespace下的指标。\n\ncurl命令调用示例:\n```\ncurl -v -H \"Content-Type:application/json\" -X GET \"https://ip:port/v1.0/{projectId}/metrics-console\"\n```\n\n**接口SLA:**\n\n|SLA项|定义|\n|-----|-----|\n|请求成功率| ≥ 99.9%|\n|可用性|Tier1|\n|数据一致性|最终一致,不一致时长<1分钟|\n|吞吐量|30 次/分钟|\n|TP50请求时延|3000 ms|\n|TP99.9请求时延|8000 ms|",
        "x-filter": "ManageOne,openapi",
        "x-precautions": "错误码:当请求不成功时,响应体内的错误码信息请参见“ManageOne 运维面API参考 > 错误码说明 > 租户保障特性”章节。\n",
        "x-plane": "Tenant,OM",
        "tags": [
          "租户保障"
        ],
        "operationId": "ShowMetricsMetaInfo",
        "consumes": [
          "application/json"
        ],
        "produces": [
          "application/json"
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "x-auth-token",
            "in": "header",
            "required": false,
            "type": "string",
            "description": "有效的token(op_service权限的用户token),token中需要包含project信息。"
          },
          {
            "name": "project_id",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "project Id。",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "namespace",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "命名空间,如 SYS.ECS。",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "order",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "查询顺序,按指标名称排序,可取值:asc(升序),desc(降序)。",
            "required": false,
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "dim.0",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "指标的维度,为了兼容公有云CES接口,该字段支持传入。",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "dim.1",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "指标的维度,目前最大支持3个维度。",
            "required": false,
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "dim.2",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "指标的维度,目前最大支持3个维度。",
            "required": false,
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "limit",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "单页的条目数,为了兼容公有云CES接口,该字段支持传入。",
            "required": false,
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "start",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "分页起始值,为了兼容公有云CES接口,该字段支持传入。",
            "required": false,
            "type": "string"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "返回指标信息。获取响应体请参考《资源北向模型》。",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "examples": {
              "application/json": {
                "metrics": [
                  {
                    "namespace": "SYS.ECS",
                    "dimensions": [
                      {
                        "name": "instance_id",
                        "value": "9886ce95-a319-468d-9e0d-2a3aae4937da"
                      }
                    ],
                    "metric_name": "cpu_util",
                    "unit": "%",
                    "name_zh_cn": "CPU使用率",
                    "name_en_us": "CPU Usage"
                  },
                  {
                    "namespace": "SYS.ECS",
                    "dimensions": [
                      {
                        "name": "instance_id",
                        "value": "9886ce95-a319-468d-9e0d-2a3aae4937da"
                      }
                    ],
                    "metric_name": "mem_util",
                    "unit": "%",
                    "name_zh_cn": "内存使用率",
                    "name_en_us": "Memory Usage"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "参数错误。"
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "URL鉴权失败。"
